  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.binding": "Experiment 250: Binding Mode",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.binding.desc": "When enabled, sneak-right-click a creature while holding Experiment 250 to bind its raw meat. If that creature has multiple configured items, interact again to cycle through them in configuration order. Any dough tagged c:foods/dough or c:dough can then replicate the raw meat bound to that Experiment 250.",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal": "Experiment 250: Fatal Protection",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.boss_blocked": "Fatal damage caused by bosses cannot trigger Fatal Protection.",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.boss_free": "Fatal damage caused by bosses can trigger Fatal Protection without counting toward the current sleep cycle's trigger limit.",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.desc": "When the player is about to take fatal damage, the mod searches %s for an Experiment 250 with more than %s Activity. It cancels the damage and consumes %s Activity; health is restored to at least half of maximum, hunger and saturation are filled, and the player gains Regeneration II for 45 seconds, Absorption II for 5 seconds, and Fire Resistance for 40 seconds. It can trigger up to %s times per sleep cycle, resetting after waking or truly dying.",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.location.baubles_or_offhand": "the offhand or bauble slots",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.location.inventory": "the offhand or inventory",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.location.offhand": "the offhand",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.fatal.non_consuming": "Fatal damage caused by the following entities can trigger Fatal Protection without counting toward the current sleep cycle's trigger limit: %s.",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.pedestal": "Experiment 250: Trophy Pedestal Network",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.pedestal.desc": "Display a Lifedrain Scepter and a non-full Experiment 250 on same-height Trophy Pedestals within a 5x5 area. Every 3 seconds, the scepter drains an ordinary unnamed, untamed creature within 3 blocks. A target without Slowness takes 1 damage, gains Slowness for 5 seconds, and grants 0.5 Activity; an already slowed target takes 3 damage and grants 1.5 Activity.",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.scepter": "Experiment 250: Lifedrain Scepter Charging",
  "twilightsparksdelightfabric.jei.experiment_250.function.scepter.desc": "With a non-full Experiment 250 in the other hand, Lifedrain Scepter restoration becomes Activity: +1 normally, or +3 from slowed targets.",
